    ContentEN = "[Dirtexpeller] has a chance to fire 1 additional projectile. Chance: 20% + 15% × Hilda's Ranged Weapon Multishot.\n[Hyperthermal Purgejet] DMG increases by 20% + 15% × Hilda's Ranged Weapon Multishot, up to {int}#1.",
