    ContentEN = "Today is your birthday. I have prepared a small gift for you — you may open it later.\nSurprised that I know? Let's just say I pulled a few strings to acquire your profile. The details, naturally, have remained etched in my memory.\nMuch has changed with time, yet my wish for your continued well-being and happiness remains the same. But if you do not mind hearing it from me... Happy Birthday.",
    ContentFR = "Aujourd’hui, c’est ton anniversaire. J’ai préparé un modeste présent que tu pourras ouvrir plus tard. {性别:Surpris|Surprise} que je sois au courant ? Disons simplement que j’ai tiré quelques ficelles pour obtenir ton dossier. Les détails, bien sûr, restent gravés dans ma mémoire.\nBeaucoup de choses ont changé avec le temps, mais mon souhait pour ta santé et ton bonheur ne s’est jamais altéré. Si tu veux bien l’entendre de ma part... Joyeux anniversaire.",
    ContentJP = "今日はあなたの誕生日だから、ささやかだけど、贈り物を用意したの。後で開けてみてね。\n 驚いた？ふふ、以前、少し手を回してあなたの情報を調べたのよ。その情報、全部記憶に刻み込んだわ。\n いろいろなことがあったけれど、あなたの無事と幸せを願う気持ちは、今も昔も変わらない。\n まだ、私の言葉に耳を傾けてくれるかはわからないけど……誕生日おめでとう。",
    ContentKR = "오늘이 네 생일이구나. 작은 선물을 준비했으니까, 조금 있다가 열어보도록 해.\n놀랐어? 네 정보는 전에 살짝 꾀를 써서 알아낸 거야. 그후로 쭉 기억하고 있었고.\n많은 일이 있었지만, 네가 평안하고 순탄하기를 바라는 마음은 예전부터 변함없었어. 혹시라도 들어줄 마음이 있다면... 생일 축하해.",
    ContentTC = "今日是你的生辰，我備了些薄禮，待會兒再拆開吧。\n很驚訝嗎？你的資料是我略施小計拿到手上的，其中的信息我一直牢牢記著。\n雖然發生了很多事情，但我願你平安順遂的心意，從往昔到今日，從未有過改變。若你還願意聽的話……生辰快樂。",
    TextMapContent = "今日是你的生辰，我备了些薄礼，待会儿再拆开吧。\n很惊讶吗？你的资料是我略施小计拿到手上的，其中的信息我一直牢牢记着。\n虽然发生了很多事情，但我愿你平安顺遂的心意，从往昔到今日，从未有过改变。若你还愿意听的话……生辰快乐。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_birthday"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_01 = {
    ContentEN = "Your perfume carries a bold, intoxicating sweetness — unrestrained, unapologetic. A striking contrast to the subtle fragrances of Huaxu. I'm intrigued.",
    ContentFR = "Ton parfum est intense, passionné, empreint d’une douceur sans retenue, un contraste marqué avec la subtilité des senteurs de Huaxu. Cela éveille ma curiosité.",
    ContentJP = "あなたの香水の香り、濃厚で情熱的ね。そして抑えの効かない甘さを漂わせているわ。華胥でよく使われる控えめな香りとはまた違っていて、とても興味深いわ。",
    ContentKR = "너한테서 나는 향수는 진하고 강렬하며, 절제되지 않은 달콤함이 느껴져. 화서에서 흔히 쓰는 은은한 향과는 확실히 다르네. 흥미로워.",
    ContentTC = "你身上香水的味道，濃郁、熱烈，散發出毫不克制的甜美。與華胥慣用香的疏淡卻是有所不同。我很感興趣。",
    TextMapContent = "你身上香水的味道，浓郁、热烈，散发出毫不克制的甜美。与华胥惯用香的疏淡却是有所不同。我很感兴趣。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_01"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_02_1 = {
    ContentEN = "Deception may serve its purpose in war, but in the finer art of human interaction, it is a blunt instrument. Overreliance on such tactics does little more than tarnish one's standing in business.",
    ContentFR = "La tromperie peut guider une bataille, mais dans les affaires et les relations, c’est une arme à double tranchant qui finit par ternir ta réputation commerciale.",
    ContentJP = "兵は詭道なり、とは戦場の理に過ぎないわ。人間関係にその手を使いすぎれば、やがて信頼を失うでしょう。",
    ContentKR = "속임수는 병법에서는 효과적일지 몰라도, 인간관계에서는 적합하지 않아요. 같은 방법을 반복해서 쓰다 보면 평판에 금이 갈 테니까요.",
    ContentTC = "兵不厭詐僅是行軍布陣之道，並非適用於人情世故的手段。一招用老了，會有損商譽。",
    TextMapContent = "兵不厌诈仅是行军布阵之道，并非适用于人情世故的手段。一招用老了，会有损商誉。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_02_1"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_02_2 = {
    ContentEN = "But, of course, you have your own way with everything. My words, I suspect, fall on deaf ears.",
    ContentFR = "Mais tu as ta manière d’agir. Mes paroles, je le crains, ne font pas d’écho en toi.",
    ContentJP = "まあ、あなたにはあなたのやり方がある。私の言葉なんて、どうぜ聞き流すのでしょう。",
    ContentKR = "그래도 당신은 당신만의 방식을 고수하겠죠. 제가 하는 말을 그냥 흘려들을 것 같지만요.",
    ContentTC = "不過，你有你的行事方式。我說的話，你大約會當成耳旁風吧。",
    TextMapContent = "不过，你有你的行事方式。我说的话，你大约会当成耳旁风吧。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_02_2"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_03 = {
    ContentEN = "I saw a trace of someone I once knew in you... No, I must be mistaken. Pay me no mind.",
    ContentFR = "J’ai cru voir en toi un reflet de quelqu’un que j’ai connu autrefois... Non, je dois me tromper. Oublie ce que je viens de dire. ",
    ContentJP = "あなたに、どこか懐かしい面影を感じたわ……いえ、ただの思い過ごしよ。忘れてちょうだい。",
    ContentKR = "너한테서는 옛 지인의 모습이 겹쳐 보여... 아니다, 내가 괜한 말을 했네.",
    ContentTC = "我在你身上看見了故人的影子……不，是我多言了。",
    TextMapContent = "我在你身上看见了故人的影子……不，是我多言了。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_03"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_04 = {
    ContentEN = "It has been some time since I last had the pleasure of tasting a drink personally prepared by you. If time allows, may I trouble you for another glass of your delightful afternoon concoction today?",
    ContentFR = "Cela fait longtemps que je n’ai pas eu le plaisir de déguster une boisson que tu as préparée. Si tu as un moment aujourd’hui, pourrais-tu m’en servir un petit verre pour accompagner l’après-midi ?",
    ContentJP = "あなたが作る酒を味わうのは、随分と久しぶりね。今日は少し時間があるの。午後のひとときを彩る一杯を、また作ってくれるかしら？",
    ContentKR = "네가 직접 만든 칵테일을 못 마신 지 오래됐네. 오늘 시간 되는데 한 잔 만들어 줄 수 있나?",
    ContentTC = "許久未品過你親手調的酒了。今日得空，可否再為我淺酌一杯午後小飲？",
    TextMapContent = "许久未品过你亲手调的酒了。今日得空，可否再为我浅酌一杯午后小饮？",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_companio_04"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_die_r01 = {
    ContentEN = "Never thought... I would miscalculate one day...",
    ContentFR = "Je n’aurais jamais cru me tromper un jour...",
    ContentJP = "私が誤算するなんてね……",
    ContentKR = "내가 실수하다니...",
    ContentTC = "我也有失算的一天嗎……",
    TextMapContent = "我也有失算的一天吗……",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_die_r01"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_die_r02 = {
    ContentEN = "So, I could not escape it in the end...",
    ContentFR = "Au final, je n’ai pas pu l’éviter...",
    ContentJP = "結局は、逃げられない運命なのね……",
    ContentKR = "결국 피하지 못했구나...",
    ContentTC = "終究未能逃過……",
    TextMapContent = "终究未能逃过……",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_die_r02"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_fail = {
    ContentEN = "Do not let despair cloud your judgment. Reassess and try again.",
    ContentFR = "Ne perds pas espoir. Change de tactique et retente ta chance.",
    ContentJP = "落ち込まないで。戦略を練り直して、もう一度挑むまでよ。",
    ContentKR = "낙심하지 말고, 전략을 다시 세워봐.",
    ContentTC = "莫灰心，重整策略再來過便是。",
    TextMapContent = "莫灰心，重整策略再来过便是。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_fail"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_gain = {
    ContentEN = "Most things in this world are but illusions — sincerity or calculation, does it truly matter? In the end, all that counts is that I stand before you, here and now.",
    ContentFR = "Le monde est fait d’ombres et de lumières, sincérité ou ruse... Est-ce si important ? Ce qui compte, c’est que je sois là, face à toi.",
    ContentJP = "この世のすべてが虚と実の交錯だとして……真心だとか計略だとか、そんなこと気にする必要があるのかしら？私はこうしてあなたに会いに来た――それだけで十分じゃない？",
    ContentKR = "세상 만물이 진짜인지 가짜인지, 진심인지 계산인지, 그런 것들이 그렇게 중요할까? 중요한 건 내가 널 만나러 왔다는 사실이지. 그것만으로도 충분해.",
    ContentTC = "世間萬物虛虛實實，真心抑或算計，會使你如此在意嗎？重要的是，我來與你相見，這就夠了。",
    TextMapContent = "世间万物虚虚实实，真心抑或算计，会使你如此在意吗？重要的是，我来与你相见，这就够了。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_gain"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_idle = {
    ContentEN = "I had my secretary clear my schedule for the next few days. For now, I wish only to savour this tranquillity with you, untouched by the clamour of the outside world. Is this out of sincerity, or another calculated move? Why don't you take a guess?",
    ContentFR = "J’ai fait repousser tous mes rendez-vous. Ces jours-ci, je veux seulement savourer la tranquillité à tes côtés, loin du tumulte extérieur. Cette fois, est-ce sincérité... ou simple stratégie ? À toi de deviner.",
    ContentJP = "最近の予定は全部秘書に調整させたわ。あなたと一緒に世間の喧騒を忘れ、静寂なひと時を過ごしたいの。――さて、これは本心かしら、それとも何か企んでいると思う？じっくり考えるといいわ。",
    ContentKR = "최근 일정은 모두 비서에게 미루라고 했어. 이번 며칠은 너와 함께하면서 외부의 소란을 잊고, 이곳의 고요를 만끽하고 싶어... 이번엔 진심일까, 아니면 다른 의도가 있을까? 한번 맞춰볼래.",
    ContentTC = "近來的日程我都讓秘書推掉了。這幾日，我只想與你待在一起，排卻外界紛擾，體會此處的清淨——這次是真心誠意，還是另有所圖？不妨猜猜看吧。",
    TextMapContent = "近来的日程我都让秘书推掉了。这几日，我只想与你待在一起，排却外界纷扰，体会此处的清净——这次是真心诚意，还是另有所图？不妨猜猜看吧。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_idle"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_lvup = {
    ContentEN = "As expected, everything falls neatly into place.",
    ContentFR = "Comme prévu, tout est sous contrôle.",
    ContentJP = "すべては私の計画通りよ。",
    ContentKR = "예상대로, 모든 게 내 손안에 있어.",
    ContentTC = "正如預料，一切都在掌握之中。",
    TextMapContent = "正如预料，一切都在掌握之中。",
    TextMapId = "voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_lvup"
  },
  voice_ch_char_Zhiliu_vo_revive = {
    ContentEN = "Did you truly think this was over? A grave miscalculation.",
    ContentFR = "Si vous pensiez que c’était fini, vous vous trompiez lourdement.",
    ContentJP = "これで終わりだと思った？なんて浅はかなのかしら。",
    ContentKR = "모든 게 끝났다고 생각하면 오산이지.",
    ContentTC = "若以為一切已經結束，就太天真了。",
    TextMapContent = "若以为一切已经结束，就太天真了。",
